  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/f17fe402f98bb01e6c434026861e42229a2db5fdddb9ac339c012f7a2b73afa8.png] \n\nLet's check each option,\n\n__Given Equation:__ **11 – 8 + 78 ÷ 6 × 37 = 64**\n\n**1) ÷ and –**\n\n→ 11 ÷ 8 + 78 - 6 × 37 = 64\n\n→ 1.3 + 78 - 6 × 37 = 64\n\n→ 1.3 + 78 - 222 = 64\n\n→ 79.3 - 222 = 64\n\n→ 142.7 ≠ 64\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**2) – and ×**\n\n**→ 11 × 8 + 78 ÷ 6 - 37 = 64**\n\n**→ 11 × 8 + 13 - 37 = 64**\n\n**​→ 88 + 13 - 37 = 64**\n\n**​→ 101 - 37 = 64**\n\n**→ 64 = 64**\n\n→ LHS = RHS → Satisfies the equation.\n\n**3) ÷ and ×**\n\n→ 11 – 8 + 78 × 6 ÷ 37 = 64\n\n→ 11 – 8 + 78 × 0.16 = 64\n\n→ 11 – 8 + 12.48 = 64\n\n→ 23.48 – 8 = 64\n\n→ 15.48 ≠ 64\n\n \n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**4) × and + **\n\n→ 11 – 8 × 78 ÷ 6 + 37 = 64\n\n→ 11 – 8 × 13 + 37 = 64\n\n→ 11 – 104 + 37 = 64\n\n→ 48 – 104 = 64\n\n→ - 56 ≠ 64\n\n→ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nHere, we can see that only Option 2 satisfies the equation.\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"**– and ×**\".\n\naf",
